{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"承接前段已经承认自己也想被珍惜的心理变化，表达的都是愿望，没有新增具体往事、外部事件、人物关系或场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"写的是爱意充盈、珍惜自身感情以及欢喜压过个人得失的心理状态，没有把珠子的比喻写成真实行动，也没有把音乐变化当作心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"对方尚未给出保证、自己仍盼望被选择，都是既有关系处境的延续，没有新增外部事件或对白。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"写的是他暂时沉浸于欢喜、暂缓考虑未来，同时预期被珍惜的愿望仍会回来，没有把珠子里的比喻当成真实行动。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"前者说明他已能承认自己想被珍惜，也知道自己的关心仍是真心的，足以支撑后者不再自责并坦然表达亲近与给予的愿望。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"前者愿意把浓烈的欢喜感受到底，可以解释后者欢喜涌起、顾不上得失，但没有直接解释他为何觉得自己有许多爱可给、这份感情值得珍惜。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"前者明确说他仍不知道对方会不会选择自己，直接支撑后者仍盼望被选择而回应尚无着落。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线也能看出他从坦然承认愿望、感到爱意充盈，到意识到回应仍未落实，最后暂时放下对未来的顾虑来享受当下，前后关系清楚。\"\n  ,\n  \"lost\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R51\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"修补后保留了想靠近的愿望，却没有明确保留“坦然承认渴望后，反而更清楚自己有多想靠近”的递进因果；S12-1只把不再自责与想靠近并列起来，未明确呈现承认渴望如何使靠近的愿望变得更清晰、更强烈。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S12-1\",\n        \"S12-2\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"S12-1已经说想把攒下的关心给对方，S12-2又说自己有许多爱可以给，核心都是爱意充盈、想要给予，连续两条略显重复；可以保留S12-1的具体给予愿望，让S12-2集中写感情值得珍惜以及欢喜压过个人得失。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2d1ce875-6d55-4bdc-b83f-e33f22b079de", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T164254293957Z", "elapsed_seconds": 467.5, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T16:50:41.815894+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "139769fa7e7aa6f641835a7387c67f6876d8d78b3a270913a51b78b92afdf0fa", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T164254293957Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "0f57788e35d3959b711fb101345e8234a503af2a51f2ae466efefca55471ad29"}}}
